      "uid": "zhcn:7a779c492d3a0ca04a55c938",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呃、被发现了。……没、没有啦，\r\n我才没有打算逃课去跑步呢！\r\n啊哈哈～！",
