      "uid": "zhcn:ffdd9dbcc76a83b7c4d9c2fa",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣诞老人总是给人一种圆圆胖胖的\r\n印象对吧……啊、别误会！\r\n我可不是因为吃太多在想借口喔！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7153267e07b67ea92d5576f875f270200e29f674d52bac4b0623d981e0ac79a0",
