    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36187bca4ded9ef9dd2da116",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔……又输给好歌剧前辈了。\r\n为什么她总是能想出\r\n那么帅气的姿势啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cc2f96a33235126b00aabc83693b2a737ade20a9292fa7a825b6671ac616a7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
