      "json_pointer": "/1008/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4f01ef686f4860a395b4f3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔唔……唔唔……哈啊──！\r\n这些蓬蓬的东西让我静不下来啊！\r\n脸好烫！这种东西不适合我啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "143105a231b423d701bbd21766a01fe204262ff04dce83b125d88657b70e91fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
