      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈，我想到早上赤骥\r\n头发乱翘的样子了。果然还是要\r\n像我这种随性的发型才最帅！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69a0d0b0d45816c5ce5f3d3198c54d681772187bca2fc9aff91419c11caca5cf",
