    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de63768d0ebc6c45d1b12da5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀～饭后想要醒脑，\r\n果然就要靠黑咖啡啊～！\r\n用苦味来提神真是……好苦。",
